BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:2026-11-28-swim_long-long-swim@rampwise
DTSTAMP:20261117T003913Z
DTSTART:20261128T063000
DTEND:20261128T071000
SUMMARY:[RW] Long swim (40 min)
DESCRIPTION:10 min warm-up\; 25 min easy\; 5 min cool-down. Continuous aer
 obic swimming (RPE 3-4). In open water practise sighting every 8-10 strok
 es\, and swim with a partner or a safety buoy. Swim time and effort\, not
  distance.\n\nWeek 1 (BASE). Not medical advice\; pain that changes how y
 ou move means stop.\nrampwise-plan
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:2026-11-29-bike_x-easy-ride-cross-trai@rampwise
DTSTAMP:20261117T003913Z
DTSTART:20261129T063000
DTEND:20261129T071000
SUMMARY:[RW] Easy ride (cross-training) (40 min)
DESCRIPTION:8 min warm-up\; 27 min easy\; 5 min cool-down. Low-impact aero
 bic work next to the running: Mostly steady endurance (RPE 2-3\, 56-75 % 
 of FTP if you use power). Eat and drink on rides over 90 minutes.\n\nWeek
  1 (BASE). Not medical advice\; pain that changes how you move means stop
 .\nrampwise-plan
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
