DTSTART:20270102T063000
DTEND:20270102T072500
SUMMARY:[RW] Long swim (55 min)
DESCRIPTION:10 min warm-up\; 7 min easy\; 3 x (8 min steady + 3 min easy)\
 ; 5 min cool-down. Continuous aerobic swimming (RPE 3-4). In open water p
 ractise sighting every 8-10 strokes\, and swim with a partner or a safety
  buoy. Race-effort blocks (RPE 4-5). Swim time and effort\, not distance.
 \n\nWeek 6 (BUILD). Not medical advice\; pain that changes how you move m
 eans stop.\nrampwise-plan
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
