DTSTART:20270103T063000
DTEND:20270103T073000
SUMMARY:[RW] Easy ride (cross-training) (60 min)
DESCRIPTION:8 min warm-up\; 47 min easy\; 5 min cool-down. Low-impact aero
 bic work next to the running: Mostly steady endurance (RPE 2-3\, 56-75 % 
 of FTP if you use power). Eat and drink on rides over 90 minutes.\n\nWeek
  6 (BUILD). Not medical advice\; pain that changes how you move means sto
 p.\nrampwise-plan
